Package: session-router-bin
Architecture: any
Depends: libsessionrouter1.1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Session network anonymous, decentralized onion routing network -- binaries
 Session Router is an IP packet onion routing network that powers low-latency,
 anonymous IP routing, as used on the Session messenger network.
 .
 This package contains the session-router binaries; most users will want to
 install the session-router-client or session-router-relay packages to include
 service files to run Session Router as a system service.

Package: libsessionrouter1.1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libsessionrouter-core1.1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Session network anonymous, decentralized onion routing network -- full library
 Session Router is an IP packet onion routing network that powers low-latency,
 anonymous IP routing, as used on the Session messenger network.
 .
 This package contains the full Session Router library, with the client and
 relay support used by the session-router daemon.

Package: libsessionrouter-core1.1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Session network anonymous, decentralized onion routing network -- core library
 Session Router is an IP packet onion routing network that powers low-latency,
 anonymous IP routing, as used on the Session messenger network.
 .
 This package contains the core Session Router library, providing the
 embedded Session Router API.

Package: libsessionrouter-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libsessionrouter1.1 (= ${binary:Version}), libsessionrouter-core1.1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Session network anonymous, decentralized onion routing network -- development files
 Session Router is an IP packet onion routing network that powers low-latency,
 anonymous IP routing, as used on the Session messenger network.
 .
 This package contains the headers and other development files needed to
 build software using the Session Router libraries.

Package: session-router-client
Architecture: all
Depends: session-router-bin (=${binary:Version}), adduser, ucf
Recommends: resolvconf
Description: Session network anonymous, decentralized onion routing network -- client service
 Session Router is an IP packet onion routing network that powers low-latency,
 anonymous IP routing, as used on the Session messenger network.
 .
 This package contains contains the configuration needed to run a Session
 Router client as a system service to allow the local system to access session
 router either as an anonymous client or as a Session service "snapp".
 .
 Most users looking to access Session Router want to install this package.

Package: session-router-relay
Architecture: all
Depends: session-router-bin (=${binary:Version}), oxend, adduser, ucf
Description: Session network anonymous, decentralized onion routing network -- service node relay
 Session Router is an IP packet onion routing network that powers low-latency,
 anonymous IP routing, as used on the Session messenger network.
 .
 This package contains contains the configuration needed to run Session Router
 as a Session staked service node relay to carry network traffic.
 .
 Users just looking to access Session Router want the 'session-router-client'
 package instead.
